        "GAMEPLAY_RULE_PLUS_TRIGGER_PLUS_PLAYER_DECISION_PLUS_SYSTEM_CONSEQUENCE"
      ]
    },
    "completionMeaning": "A breadth cycle means the game has received meaningful connected improvements across world/background, enemies/bosses, quests/story, items/equipment, gameplay rules/events, mid-late/endgame depth, and presentation. It does not mean cloning one feature into seven names."
